    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.crisis.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.crisis.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "黒い角封筒は、湯呑みの隣にあった。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.crisis.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.crisis.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "出口ゼロ。お客を、帰さない施設。それは、あの誤出口の頃の、彼の一番の恐怖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.crisis.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.crisis.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "会社が「仕様」として、書き直したものだった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.crisis.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.crisis.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……白状します。この通告を読んだ夜、少しだけ、思ってしまったのです。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.crisis.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.crisis.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "出口がなければ、誰も、帰らない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.crisis.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.crisis.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "「また来るよ」に、二度と、待ちぼうけを食わされない——と。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.crisis.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.crisis.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "正直な建築だった。会社の通告は、彼の古い傷の、一番柔らかいところを正確に突いている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.crisis.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.crisis.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "物語資産管理部は、弱みの台帳でも持ってるんだろうか。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.crisis.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.crisis.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "十七号室さん。ひとつ、思い出してください。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.crisis.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.crisis.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "閉じ込めたお客さんの顔と、「また来ます」って言って本当に来たお客さんの顔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.crisis.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.crisis.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "あなたが見たいのは、どっちですか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.crisis.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.crisis.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "沈黙の間、耳だけが、やけに澄んでいた。それから、部屋中の扉が一斉に、静かに開いた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.crisis.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.crisis.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "百二十階の全フロア、全部の出口が。彼の答えは、言葉ではなく建築で来た。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "room-seventeen.crisis.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "shake"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.crisis.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.crisis.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "回答書を、お願いします。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.crisis.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.crisis.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "「当室は、出口を増やします。帰れる部屋にしか、また来たいお客様は、いらっしゃらないので」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.crisis.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.crisis.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……あなたの、受け売りですが。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.crisis.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.crisis.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "受け売り、上等。回答書を清書して、証拠資料を一枚添えた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.crisis.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.crisis.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "彼の予約台帳。会議室予約、休憩の常連、チームの帰り部屋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.crisis.node.line.008c",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.crisis.line.008c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "リピーターの一覧。帰れる部屋に、人はちゃんと、戻ってきている。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.crisis.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.crisis.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "会社は「収益性の再検討」を持ち出してくるだろう。こちらは、満室で答える。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.crisis.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.crisis.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "出口が全部開いたままの迷宮に、お客が何人残るか。数えてもらおう。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
